# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.
#
# SYNTAX WARNING: .gitignore has no inline comments. A "#" only starts a comment
# when it is the first character of a line; written after a pattern it is read as
# part of that pattern, and the rule silently stops matching everything. The
# original version of this file did exactly that to config/api_keys.json,
# config/certs/, config/whatsapp_web/ and **/token*.json — four secret rules that
# protected nothing. Keep every explanation on its own line.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────

# Your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials.
config/api_keys.json

# Live API-key lists per provider (gemini, grok, openrouter, ollama_cloud,
# tavily), maintained by the settings screen.
config/providers.json

# The dashboard's TLS private key and certificate.
config/certs/

# A LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp
# account, not just a key.
config/whatsapp_web/

# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar / Contacts plugins) and client secrets.
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json

# The Spotify MCP server's live OAuth grant (clientSecret + access/refresh
# tokens). spotify-config.example.json is the committed template.
**/spotify-config.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# Skills you taught JARVIS.
memory/skills.json

# Agent task history and their results.
memory/agent_tasks.json

# Text extracted from your private documents.
memory/document_rag.json

# A file the assistant downloaded — not project source.
telegram_download.png

# ── Generated caches and code — rebuilt on demand, large ──────────────────────

# System-wide file index (tens of MB, rebuilt at startup).
memory/file_index.json

# Skill Forge–generated feature code.
features/

# ── Python and Node build noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
node_modules/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.pid
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
